@startuml
title Prepwise — TestAttempt lifecycle
[*] --> "Not Started"
"Not Started" --> "In Progress" : start / persist started_at
"In Progress" --> Submitted : student submits valid answers
"In Progress" --> Expired : server deadline reached
Expired --> Evaluated : auto-submit and score
Submitted --> Evaluated : validate, score, persist
Evaluated --> [*] : result available
note right of "In Progress"
  Correct answers remain on the server.
  Only the owner (or admin) can view results.
end note
note bottom of Evaluated
  Repeated submissions do not change
  a completed attempt.
end note
@enduml
